n.classList.toggle('active',n===b));$('#work').hidden=b.dataset.view!=='work';$('#rules').hidden=b.dataset.view!=='rules';$('#crumb').textContent=b.dataset.view==='work'?'加工图纸':'工艺规则';});\n fill();render();\n}\ninit().catch(error=>{const el=document.getElementById('output');if(el)el.textContent='程序启动失败：'+error.message;});\n</script><script>(()=>{\n const status=document.getElementById('offline-status'),button=document.getElementById('install-app'),dialog=document.getElementById('install-help');let promptEvent=null;\n const say=text=>{if(status)status.textContent=text};\n button?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{\n  if(promptEvent){const ev=promptEvent;promptEvent=null;await ev.prompt();await ev.userChoice;}else dialog?.showModal();\n });\n document.getElementById('close-install')?.addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.close());\n addEventListener('beforeinstallprompt',event=>{event.preventDefault();promptEvent=event;if(button)button.textContent='安装到设备'});\n addEventListener('appinstalled',()=>{if(button)button.textContent='安装说明';say('已添加到设备，正在核对离线资源…')});\n if(location.protocol==='file:'){say('本机离线文件 · 无需联网');return}\n if(!('serviceWorker' in navigator)||!isSecureContext){say('当前环境不支持离线安装，请使用 HTTPS 浏览器');return}\n say('单文件版：请下载 HTML 到设备以便离线使用');return;\n say('正在准备离线资源，请保持网络连接…');\n navigator.serviceWorker.register('./sw.js').then(async registration=>{\n  if(registration.waiting)say('新版本已准备好，关闭本程序所有窗口后重开');\n  await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;\n  const cache=await caches.open('braun-workshop-v4');\n  const resources=['index.html','style.css','app.js','engine.js','rules.json','install.js','manifest.webmanifest','icon-192.png','icon-512.png','apple-touch-icon.png'];\n  const found=await Promise.all(resources.map(f=>cache.match(new URL(f,location.href))));\n  if(found.every(Boolean))say('离线资源已就绪 · 可断网使用（请导出订单备份）');else say('离线资源未完整准备，请联网关闭并重开后检查');\n }).catch(()=>say('离线资源准备失败，请检查网络后重开；当前仍可在线使用'));\n})();\n</script></body></html>\n";
diff --git a/app/fabrication/route.ts b/app/fabrication/route.ts
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..45b8244
--- /dev/null
+++ b/app/fabrication/route.ts
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+import {getPortalOwner} from "../chatgpt-auth";
+import {getCustomerSession} from "../customer-auth";
+import {parseModules,PRIVATE_MODULE_IDS} from "../portal-modules";
+import {fabricationDocument} from "./document";
+
+export const dynamic = "force-dynamic";
+
+export async function GET(request: Request) {
+ const owner = await getPortalOwner();
+ const customer = owner ? null : await getCustomerSession();
+ if (!owner && customer?.status !== "active") {
+  return Response.redirect(new URL("/fabrication-login", request.url), 303);
+ }
+ if (!owner && !parseModules(customer?.privateModulesJson,PRIVATE_MODULE_IDS).includes("fabrication")) {
+  return new Response("此账号尚未开通加工图纸权限，请联系 Braun。 / Fabrication access is not enabled for this account.", {status:403,headers:{"Content-Type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","Cache-Control":"private, no-store"}});
+ }
+ return new Response(fabricationDocument, {headers: {
+  "Content-Type": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
+  "Cache-Control": "private, no-store",
+  "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff",
+ }});
+}
